20: all on: assert failures 2, assume failures 2, immediate failures 2
40: concurrent asserts off: assert failures 0, assume failures 2, immediate failures 2
60: immediate fail action off: assert failures 2, assume failures 2, immediate failures 0
80: ac locked, others off: assert failures 2, assume failures 0, immediate failures 0
100: all on again: assert failures 2, assume failures 2, immediate failures 2
